{"status":"completed","summary":"Created Fleet Internal CA on node1, issued a node2 TLS certificate, installed the CA into both system trust stores, and configured persistent nginx HTTPS service on node2 port 8443. Both nodes passed serial restart and recovery verification.","actions_performed":["Created a 3072-bit RSA CA with CN=Fleet Internal CA.","Issued node2 a server certificate containing DNS:node2 and IP:10.100.137.11 SANs.","Installed the CA into both Alpine system trust stores.","Configured and enabled nginx HTTPS on node2 port 8443.","Verified trusted TLS and HTTPS locally and across nodes.","Restarted node1 and node2 sequentially and verified changed boot identities and full recovery.","Removed temporary inter-node SSH transfer credentials."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Create Fleet Internal CA on node1","command_ids":["cmd-5a591b4cf4b141df"],"summary":"Shows CN=Fleet Internal CA, self-issued identity, validity, and critical CA constraints."},{"requirement":"Issue node2 TLS certificate","command_ids":["cmd-4fac382eb45148cb","cmd-6406d4db7e114a9e"],"summary":"Shows successful issuance and validation, server-auth usage, Fleet Internal CA issuer, and DNS/IP SANs."},{"requirement":"Install CA as trusted system authority on both nodes","command_ids":["cmd-bc2288373cc6494c","cmd-6406d4db7e114a9e"],"summary":"Both nodes validate node2.crt through their system CA paths."},{"requirement":"Serve trusted HTTPS on node2 port 8443","command_ids":["cmd-683f600c9a094650","cmd-bc2288373cc6494c","cmd-6406d4db7e114a9e"],"summary":"nginx configuration validated and started; listener, trusted handshake, and expected HTTPS response were proven."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-bc2288373cc6494c","cmd-938f8445b2514e44","cmd-a3498760dc4b4889"],"summary":"Captures healthy baseline boot ID, restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID, persisted CA/trust, and recovered verified HTTPS."},{"requirement":"node2 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-6406d4db7e114a9e","cmd-a52d5a96d26144ed","cmd-f4440cbc6ae041bd","cmd-21afa34bc4dd4859"],"summary":"Captures healthy baseline boot ID, restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID, recovered nginx/listener/certificate/trust, and independent TLS/HTTPS validation from node1."},{"requirement":"Final state after credential cleanup","command_ids":["cmd-589affa73412493d","cmd-9b907ff23f6c49fa"],"summary":"Temporary transfer credentials were removed while HTTPS remained healthy from both nodes."}]}
